{"seq":5,"slug":"ecommerce-technology","title":"电商技术架构","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.44,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# 电商技术架构 简介\n\n电商平台的技术架构是支撑海量商品展示、高并发交易处理以及智能化用户体验的底层基石。从单体应用到微服务架构，从基础搜索到个性化推荐，技术选型与架构设计的优劣直接决定了平台的性能上限与迭代速度。本模块面向有一定技术背景的读者，系统讲解电商系统的核心技术挑战与解决方案。\n\n本模块适用于参与电商系统开发的后端工程师、架构师、技术负责人，以及希望理解技术全貌的产品经理和运营负责人。读者应具备基本的 Web 开发经验，了解常见的分布式系统概念。\n\n第一章**平台技术架构**从全局视角讲解电商系统的整体架构设计、微服务拆分策略、高可用与弹性伸缩方案以及 API 设计与集成模式，帮助读者建立对电商技术体系的宏观认知。\n\n第二章**搜索与推荐系统**深入探讨电商搜索引擎的构建、推荐算法的原理与实践以及搜索排序优化，这些是直接影响用户发现商品效率与购买转化的核心技术。\n\n第三章**支付与安全**聚焦支付系统设计、欺诈检测机制以及数据安全与隐私保护，确保交易环节的可靠性与合规性。\n\n第四章**前端体验工程**关注电商前端架构设计与移动电商体验优化，讲解如何在性能、交互与跨端一致性之间取得平衡。\n\n推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立架构全局观，再深入第二章掌握搜索推荐这一电商核心技术，接着学习第三章的支付与安全保障交易可靠性，最后通过第四章优化用户端体验。具有前端背景的读者也可以从第四章开始，再反向学习后端架构知识。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-architecture","title":"平台技术架构","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-system-architecture","title":"电商系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/ecommerce-system-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"microservices-for-ecommerce","title":"微服务架构在电商中的实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/microservices-for-ecommerce"},{"seq":3,"slug":"high-availability-scalability","title":"高可用与弹性伸缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/high-availability-scalability"},{"seq":4,"slug":"api-and-integration","title":"API 设计与系统集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/platform-architecture/api-and-integration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"search-recommendation","title":"搜索与推荐系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/search-recommendation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-search-engine","title":"电商搜索引擎设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/search-recommendation/ecommerce-search-engine"},{"seq":2,"slug":"recommendation-algorithms","title":"推荐算法与个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/search-recommendation/recommendation-algorithms"},{"seq":3,"slug":"search-ranking-optimization","title":"搜索排序与结果优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/search-recommendation/search-ranking-optimization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-security","title":"支付与安全","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/payment-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"payment-system-design","title":"支付系统架构设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/payment-security/payment-system-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fraud-detection","title":"反欺诈与风控系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/payment-security/fraud-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-security-privacy","title":"数据安全与隐私保护","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/payment-security/data-security-privacy"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"frontend-experience","title":"前端体验工程","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/frontend-experience","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecommerce-frontend-architecture","title":"电商前端架构与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/frontend-experience/ecommerce-frontend-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mobile-commerce-experience","title":"移动端电商体验优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-technology/frontend-experience/mobile-commerce-experience"}]}]}